1
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:12,070
Yuuri...

2
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:15,240
And, also...

3
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:15,240
I think I fell for Mabuchi-kun!

4
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:15,240
Well, I...

5
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,240
...likes Kou...

6
00:00:41,310 --> 00:00:45,190
The world has fallen in love

7
00:00:45,190 --> 00:00:48,860
An arrow of light shoots through my heart

8
00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:52,150
I just want to understand you

9
00:00:52,150 --> 00:00:56,530
Won't you open up to me?

10
00:01:03,450 --> 00:01:07,670
A fumbled exchange of words leaves a little taste of regret

11
00:01:09,130 --> 00:01:11,000
Enough to make me cry

12
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:16,340
I want to link my racing emotions to the beat of my heart

13
00:01:16,340 --> 00:01:23,470
and put it all in tune

14
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:29,310
I lost sight of everything but my goal

15
00:01:29,310 --> 00:01:32,980
and had something important fade away

16
00:01:32,980 --> 00:01:39,240
Let's start all over

17
00:01:40,490 --> 00:01:44,370
The world has fallen in love

18
00:01:44,370 --> 00:01:47,620
An arrow of light shoots through my heart

19
00:01:47,620 --> 00:01:51,210
I want to know everything about you

20
00:01:51,210 --> 00:01:55,380
Won't you tell me more?

21
00:01:55,380 --> 00:01:59,010
One inch feels like a million miles

22
00:01:59,010 --> 00:02:01,930
as the days just seem to race by

23
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:06,350
I won't and can't ever forget

24
00:02:06,350 --> 00:02:09,600
this brightest page of my life.

25
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:18,360
Futaba-chan!

26
00:02:20,740 --> 00:02:22,160
Morning!

27
00:02:22,160 --> 00:02:23,660
Yuuri...

28
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:26,080
G-Good morning.

29
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:27,000
You okay?

30
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:27,830
Huh?

31
00:02:27,830 --> 00:02:30,380
Does your foot still hurt?

32
00:02:30,380 --> 00:02:34,590
Oh, yeah. The pain's pretty much gone.

33
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:36,960
That's great!

34
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:46,180
Hey, sorry I didn't respond to your text yesterday.

35
00:02:46,180 --> 00:02:49,770
I passed out like a sack of potatoes when I got home.

36
00:02:49,770 --> 00:02:51,690
What, that's it?

37
00:02:52,770 --> 00:02:58,440
I was terrified that you were mad at me or something.

38
00:02:58,440 --> 00:03:00,820
Oh man, I'm so sorry!

39
00:03:00,820 --> 00:03:03,280
You didn't do anything wrong, Yuuri!

40
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:06,660
I thought, maybe...

41
00:03:07,870 --> 00:03:12,080
...you also liked Mabuchi-kun...

42
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:14,460
No way! Not a chance in hell!

43
00:03:12,290 --> 00:03:14,590
Relfex

44
00:03:16,710 --> 00:03:19,170
I did it again...

45
00:03:19,170 --> 00:03:20,170
Really?

46
00:03:21,010 --> 00:03:22,140
Yeah...

47
00:03:24,430 --> 00:03:29,100
But there's no way I can take that back after seeing her this relieved...

48
00:03:30,390 --> 00:03:34,270
No problem. I just have to make sure I don't fall for Kou.

49
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:38,230
All those feelings I confused for love

50
00:03:38,230 --> 00:03:40,530
were just a lapse in judgement.

51
00:03:41,110 --> 00:03:45,990
When a mean person acts nice for once, they suddenly look like angels.

52
00:03:45,990 --> 00:03:47,450
That must be it.

53
00:03:47,830 --> 00:03:53,290
There are plenty of people out there just like him.

54
00:03:54,420 --> 00:03:57,880
It's not like... Kou's special or anything.

55
00:04:00,210 --> 00:04:02,430
Not one bit!

56
00:04:03,090 --> 00:04:06,140
Can I help you, or are you just angry for no reason?

57
00:04:06,140 --> 00:04:07,810
N-N-No, it's nothing.

58
00:04:07,810 --> 00:04:09,640
Good morning, Mabuchi-kun.

59
00:04:09,640 --> 00:04:11,020
Oh, hey.

60
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:13,480
See you in class.

61
00:04:16,730 --> 00:04:21,860
Yuuri, you're making your crush way too obvious.

62
00:04:21,860 --> 00:04:23,570
I know, but...

63
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:28,530
It'd be nice if he noticed I was acting different.

64
00:04:32,750 --> 00:04:36,960
I guess she really does love Kou now.

65
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:43,510
Yuuri is radiant when she's in love.

66
00:04:47,890 --> 00:04:50,470
Makita-san, you like Mabuchi now?

67
00:04:52,890 --> 00:04:54,810
It's a secret!

68
00:04:55,810 --> 00:04:59,520
Anyway, why are you two eating here?

69
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:01,860
Don't be like that. Let's have lunch together.

70
00:05:01,860 --> 00:05:03,400
Yeah!

71
00:05:04,030 --> 00:05:06,780
...Well,
not that I mind

72
00:05:06,780 --> 00:05:11,490
Hey, Futaba-chan. You went to the same middle school as Mabuchi-kun, right?

73
00:05:11,490 --> 00:05:15,960
Huh? We did, but only for the first semester in our first year.

74
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:20,500
What was Mabuchi-kun like back then?

75
00:05:22,460 --> 00:05:24,880
Hmm, back in middle school...

76
00:05:25,260 --> 00:05:28,850
fidget

77
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:28,850
Kou used to be more like a fresh breeze.

78
00:05:28,850 --> 00:05:29,890
Really?

79
00:05:29,890 --> 00:05:31,140
Really...

80
00:05:31,140 --> 00:05:34,980
He was way shorter than he is now, and his voice was higher too.

81
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:38,770
He was quiet and easy to get along with.

82
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:41,770
Not a thing like he is now.

83
00:05:42,780 --> 00:05:44,570
Right now, Kou's more like...

84
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:48,570
"I don't even try. Aren't I cool?"

85
00:05:48,410 --> 00:05:52,660
Pretending she thinks
nothing of Kou

86
00:05:48,570 --> 00:05:51,620
It's ridiculous!

87
00:05:51,620 --> 00:05:52,660
Futaba-chan!

88
00:05:57,040 --> 00:06:00,130
Then maybe I should try some things out on you.

89
00:06:01,340 --> 00:06:04,010
I was just kidding! That seriously hurts!

90
00:06:04,010 --> 00:06:05,720
Where's your apology?

91
00:06:06,220 --> 00:06:08,840
F-Forgive me...

92
00:06:10,340 --> 00:06:11,800
You two are so funny!

93
00:06:12,470 --> 00:06:16,230
How was that funny? I'm dying over here!

94
00:06:16,230 --> 00:06:18,020
Have some sympathy!

95
00:06:18,020 --> 00:06:21,230
Nah, I wouldn't do this to a girl.

96
00:06:21,230 --> 00:06:22,860
Excuse me?

97
00:06:23,270 --> 00:06:24,980
Only if they're girls, you know?

98
00:06:24,980 --> 00:06:27,400
I won't lay a hand on Makita.

99
00:06:28,030 --> 00:06:29,740
A girl...

100
00:06:32,450 --> 00:06:34,040
Kou.

101
00:06:34,410 --> 00:06:36,580
You went too far.

102
00:06:36,580 --> 00:06:40,830
I'd never do something like that to a girl.

103
00:06:41,500 --> 00:06:43,960
I wouldn't.

104
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:44,670
White Knighting

105
00:06:44,670 --> 00:06:46,840
Who are you to talk?

106
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:50,050
You're the guy who brought porn to the camp.

107
00:06:50,050 --> 00:06:52,640
Hey! What are you saying in front of Murao?!

108
00:06:55,060 --> 00:06:57,100
Don't drag me into this.

109
00:06:59,350 --> 00:07:01,060
You hear that?

110
00:07:01,980 --> 00:07:05,020
I even shared the porn with you!

111
00:07:05,020 --> 00:07:06,900
Damn you!

112
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:09,950
What, couldn't hold it in for two days?

113
00:07:09,150 --> 00:07:10,700
Are you middle schoolers?

114
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,670
Good job!

115
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:31,930
I'm so unathletic.

116
00:07:31,930 --> 00:07:33,050
No worries.

117
00:07:34,260 --> 00:07:35,470
Over there!

118
00:07:44,770 --> 00:07:47,400
Mabuchi-kun is so cool.

119
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:50,400
I'm so jealous of you, Futaba-chan.

120
00:07:51,530 --> 00:07:55,240
You're close to Mabuchi-kun,
so you know all about him.

121
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,990
I-I wouldn't say that.

122
00:07:56,990 --> 00:07:59,790
Hey, what's his favorite food?

123
00:07:59,790 --> 00:08:02,160
Huh? Yeah, I wonder...

124
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:05,130
Then what about music? What's he into?

125
00:08:05,130 --> 00:08:08,670
Dunno, I've never asked him.

126
00:08:08,670 --> 00:08:11,340
What do you think he does on weekends?

127
00:08:11,340 --> 00:08:13,840
Um, I don't know that either...

128
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:16,300
Then how about his favorite color?

129
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:33,280
You know, I've actually been interested in him for a while now.

130
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:34,740
You have?

131
00:08:36,740 --> 00:08:40,080
But I didn't realize that I liked him

132
00:08:40,910 --> 00:08:44,370
until he helped me cross that river.

133
00:08:45,460 --> 00:08:47,710
He's really nice,

134
00:08:48,630 --> 00:08:50,210
and he makes my heart race,

135
00:08:50,710 --> 00:08:53,800
but more than that, he's reliable.

136
00:08:52,170 --> 00:08:54,130
Super punch!

137
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:59,180
Yuuri really is cute.

138
00:09:06,560 --> 00:09:10,070
All right, homeroom's over.

139
00:09:11,230 --> 00:09:12,230
Let's go home.

140
00:09:12,230 --> 00:09:13,070
Sure.

141
00:09:13,070 --> 00:09:14,860
Murao-san, wanna come with?

142
00:09:16,610 --> 00:09:17,700
Oh, right.

143
00:09:18,410 --> 00:09:20,410
Hey, class reps.

144
00:09:20,950 --> 00:09:25,120
You need to write up a report on the leadership course.

145
00:09:25,660 --> 00:09:26,670
Take this.

146
00:09:28,170 --> 00:09:29,880
Why just the class reps?

147
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:31,500
Why not just the class reps?

148
00:09:33,050 --> 00:09:34,380
How lucky...

149
00:09:35,380 --> 00:09:38,550
Kou, I'll take care of it, so you can go...

150
00:09:38,550 --> 00:09:40,050
What are you talking about?

151
00:09:41,810 --> 00:09:46,350
I can't just leave you to write it alone with a clear conscience.

152
00:09:46,690 --> 00:09:48,310
There you go again.

153
00:09:48,310 --> 00:09:53,280
Your words are honorable, but I know you just want to be alone with a girl.

154
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:54,570
Girl?

155
00:09:54,570 --> 00:09:55,900
Where?

156
00:09:56,990 --> 00:10:00,740
Have fun, closet perv. See ya.

157
00:10:00,740 --> 00:10:02,620
Don't hit me, stupid.

158
00:10:02,620 --> 00:10:04,450
Tell me about it tomorrow.

159
00:10:12,130 --> 00:10:13,880
Sorry, Futaba-chan.

160
00:10:14,210 --> 00:10:17,130
I'd stay and help if I didn't already have plans.

161
00:10:17,130 --> 00:10:19,550
Don't worry about it. Bye-bye, Yuuri.

162
00:10:19,550 --> 00:10:21,100
Yeah, bye-bye.

163
00:10:21,390 --> 00:10:23,640
Mabuchi-kun, see you tomorrow.

164
00:10:23,640 --> 00:10:25,430
Sure, see you.

165
00:10:29,810 --> 00:10:32,940
Alright, let's get this over with.

166
00:10:32,940 --> 00:10:33,770
Yeah.

167
00:10:33,770 --> 00:10:36,820
I'll do this page. The girl can do the other one.

168
00:10:36,820 --> 00:10:38,110
Okay...

169
00:10:51,420 --> 00:10:54,420
I'm getting butterflies in my stomach...

170
00:10:55,380 --> 00:10:58,880
This feeling is new.

171
00:11:03,350 --> 00:11:07,060
Class 2-2

172
00:11:03,350 --> 00:11:07,060
Leadership Course Report

173
00:11:03,350 --> 00:11:07,060
Mabuchi Kou

174
00:11:04,260 --> 00:11:07,060
Kou's unexpectedly neat handwriting...

175
00:11:07,810 --> 00:11:09,520
His thin fingers...

176
00:11:10,770 --> 00:11:11,980
His shoulders...

177
00:11:13,980 --> 00:11:18,530
His eyes visible through the gaps in his bangs...

178
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,910
Everything...

179
00:11:24,450 --> 00:11:26,620
Every little thing makes me anxious...

180
00:11:28,750 --> 00:11:30,830
This might be bad.

181
00:11:32,170 --> 00:11:36,420
Yuuri likes him now!

182
00:12:28,680 --> 00:12:30,020
Get writing.

183
00:12:30,020 --> 00:12:32,270
I haven't seen your hand move in a while.

184
00:12:32,270 --> 00:12:33,270
S-Sorry—

185
00:12:33,270 --> 00:12:34,190
Give it here.

186
00:12:34,690 --> 00:12:36,150
Completely blank!

187
00:12:36,150 --> 00:12:37,650
I'll do it, I promise.

188
00:12:37,650 --> 00:12:40,900
I can't believe you volunteered to do the whole thing by yourself.

189
00:12:41,610 --> 00:12:43,070
You're unbelievable.

190
00:12:44,030 --> 00:12:46,070
Still working on it?

191
00:12:46,070 --> 00:12:48,410
Yeah, it'll take a bit longer.

192
00:12:48,410 --> 00:12:50,700
Bring it to the faculty office when you're done.

193
00:12:50,700 --> 00:12:52,250
Yeah, got it.

194
00:12:52,250 --> 00:12:53,960
Okay.

195
00:12:56,710 --> 00:12:59,420
I don't consider you a pervert, Kou.

196
00:13:01,210 --> 00:13:02,130
What?

197
00:13:04,380 --> 00:13:07,090
Is there something on my back?

198
00:13:08,220 --> 00:13:11,930
Pervy

199
00:13:09,010 --> 00:13:11,930
Uh, yeah. There is.

200
00:13:11,930 --> 00:13:13,560
You've got to be kidding me.

201
00:13:14,100 --> 00:13:15,310
That little...

202
00:13:15,310 --> 00:13:16,900
Pervy!

203
00:13:16,900 --> 00:13:18,520
Grab it for me.

204
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:19,860
Sure...

205
00:13:33,370 --> 00:13:34,870
This isn't fair.

206
00:13:35,410 --> 00:13:38,710
I just can't resist the back of his neck.

207
00:13:41,880 --> 00:13:42,710
Don't sniff me.

208
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:46,470
I know you've been taking whiffs of me.

209
00:13:46,470 --> 00:13:47,430
What's wrong with you?

210
00:13:47,430 --> 00:13:50,680
What?! I haven't taken whiffs of anyone! Prove it!

211
00:13:50,680 --> 00:13:51,640
I know you do!

212
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:54,770
Like back when I carried you during orienteering.

213
00:13:54,770 --> 00:13:58,230
And the time you were rubbing my head in the lobby at the inn.

214
00:13:58,230 --> 00:14:00,980
I-I wouldn't say I sniffed you!

215
00:14:00,980 --> 00:14:02,860
I just happened to smell you...

216
00:14:02,860 --> 00:14:03,860
And also...

217
00:14:04,190 --> 00:14:06,320
No also! Those were the only times!

218
00:14:07,650 --> 00:14:09,530
When we played cops and robbers.

219
00:14:20,920 --> 00:14:22,090
He knew.

220
00:14:25,380 --> 00:14:28,220
Even his payback is lame.

221
00:14:28,220 --> 00:14:29,090
What's the deal with this?

222
00:14:29,590 --> 00:14:32,300
Come on, give me your sheet.

223
00:14:32,300 --> 00:14:34,060
It'll be faster if I do it.

224
00:14:34,060 --> 00:14:35,680
I'm sorry.

225
00:14:36,270 --> 00:14:39,520
He knew... he knew!

226
00:14:39,520 --> 00:14:41,480
You're telling me.

227
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:46,570
If I wasn't around, you'd be here all night.

228
00:14:47,650 --> 00:14:49,110
What do I do...

229
00:14:50,280 --> 00:14:54,120
This is bad. Every time I think of Kou,

230
00:14:56,040 --> 00:14:58,210
Yuuri's face comes to mind.

231
00:15:03,920 --> 00:15:04,880
What?

232
00:15:07,210 --> 00:15:09,340
I was just admiring the sky.

233
00:15:14,300 --> 00:15:18,890
Aw, man. I wish I was a class rep.

234
00:15:20,270 --> 00:15:23,440
Futaba-chan said she didn't like Mabuchi-kun,

235
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:28,280
but there's no telling what he thinks of her.

236
00:15:28,280 --> 00:15:30,320
Hey, what do you think?

237
00:15:31,700 --> 00:15:33,990
How am I supposed to know?

238
00:15:35,620 --> 00:15:37,740
I can't get it off my mind!

239
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:43,540
Being in love is really uplifting,

240
00:15:43,540 --> 00:15:45,960
but sometimes it brings you down, too.

241
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:01,100
We managed to finish up pretty early.

242
00:16:07,900 --> 00:16:11,240
If I spend any more time with Kou alone...

243
00:16:13,490 --> 00:16:14,200
Kou.

244
00:16:15,450 --> 00:16:19,040
I can hand the report in by myself.

245
00:16:20,660 --> 00:16:22,410
Oh, you'll do it?

246
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:24,500
Thanks, then.

247
00:16:24,500 --> 00:16:25,460
Bye.

248
00:16:28,210 --> 00:16:30,050
This is definitely bad.

249
00:16:30,760 --> 00:16:33,130
I won't be able to turn back.

250
00:16:38,060 --> 00:16:42,560
Faculty Office

251
00:16:38,510 --> 00:16:40,560
Got it, thanks.

252
00:16:40,560 --> 00:16:42,020
Excuse me, then.

253
00:16:59,030 --> 00:17:00,490
Why...

254
00:17:11,210 --> 00:17:13,260
Kou, why are you here?

255
00:17:15,130 --> 00:17:16,550
What do you mean?

256
00:17:17,140 --> 00:17:18,350
I'm waiting for you.

257
00:17:20,560 --> 00:17:24,890
Didn't you say to wait up while you were handing the report in?

258
00:17:27,900 --> 00:17:31,360
I meant for you to go on home without me.

259
00:17:32,990 --> 00:17:34,440
Oh, did you?

260
00:17:34,990 --> 00:17:39,160
But we take the same train,
so wouldn't that be kind of strange?

261
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:40,870
I-I guess so.

262
00:17:40,870 --> 00:17:42,540
Well, whatever.

263
00:17:47,120 --> 00:17:48,130
Let's go.

264
00:17:50,840 --> 00:17:52,090
At this rate...

265
00:17:52,710 --> 00:17:54,800
I'll really fall in love.

266
00:18:03,180 --> 00:18:08,690
Man, first that apology essay and now this report—all this writing is killing me.

267
00:18:13,530 --> 00:18:17,070
And the event planners get out of everything scot-free.

268
00:18:23,830 --> 00:18:24,750
But...

269
00:18:25,790 --> 00:18:26,460
Yuuri.

270
00:18:32,170 --> 00:18:38,130
What should I do when I've fallen for the same boy my friend has?

271
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:44,140
If this is how it's going to feel,
I'd rather forget all about Kou.

272
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:48,600
But... I want to love.

273
00:18:49,520 --> 00:18:52,560
But... but...

274
00:18:53,270 --> 00:18:54,230
But!

275
00:19:03,580 --> 00:19:05,240
Our train's right here.

276
00:19:07,330 --> 00:19:12,710
Please, just let somebody make the decision for me.

277
00:19:16,460 --> 00:19:17,420
Kou!

278
00:19:19,090 --> 00:19:21,300
I think I forgot something.

279
00:19:22,390 --> 00:19:23,680
So...

280
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:28,890
If Kou doesn't get off the train,
then I'll forget all about him.

281
00:19:28,890 --> 00:19:31,310
What, you forgot something?

282
00:19:33,310 --> 00:19:36,440
If he gets off, then I'll love him.

283
00:19:36,440 --> 00:19:37,480
I see.

284
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:44,070
If he stays, I'll forget. If he gets off, I'll love.

285
00:19:46,410 --> 00:19:51,040
If he stays, I'll forget. If he gets off, I'll love.

286
00:19:51,710 --> 00:19:53,750
If he stays, I'll forget.

287
00:19:53,750 --> 00:19:56,420
If he gets off, I'll love.

288
00:19:56,420 --> 00:19:58,960
The doors will be closing momentarily.

289
00:20:02,510 --> 00:20:03,430
If he stays...

290
00:20:06,050 --> 00:20:11,890
Before I knew it, I had run

291
00:20:06,050 --> 00:20:11,890
kudarizaka fumikiri made

292
00:20:07,100 --> 00:20:08,270
Get off!

293
00:20:11,890 --> 00:20:16,900
all the way down to the train tracks.

294
00:20:11,890 --> 00:20:16,900
atashi wa muchuu de hashitta

295
00:20:16,900 --> 00:20:22,570
What I found was a train departing,

296
00:20:16,900 --> 00:20:22,570
kono koi wo saegiru you ni

297
00:20:22,570 --> 00:20:27,450
densha wa sugisatta

298
00:20:22,570 --> 00:20:27,450
taking my love with it.

299
00:20:27,450 --> 00:20:33,120
Distant memories, shining seas.

300
00:20:27,450 --> 00:20:33,120
tooi hi no kioku umi no kagayaki

301
00:20:33,120 --> 00:20:36,000
Seasons pass.

302
00:20:33,120 --> 00:20:36,000
kisetsu wa meguru

303
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:40,380
Now, I squint up at the clouds.

304
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:40,380
hikoukigumo ni me wo hosomete

305
00:20:40,380 --> 00:20:45,760
A sunflower swayed in the breeze,

306
00:20:40,380 --> 00:20:45,760
chiisaku yureta himawari

307
00:20:45,760 --> 00:20:52,140
sayonara mo ienai mata

308
00:20:45,760 --> 00:20:52,140
seeing how I couldn't even say goodbye.

309
00:20:49,260 --> 00:20:52,020
So, did you leave it at school?

310
00:20:52,140 --> 00:21:01,990
We were so tantalizingly close, yet so far apart.

311
00:20:52,140 --> 00:21:01,990
hon no suumiri no sukima de sotto kusuguru itami

312
00:20:52,480 --> 00:20:53,850
Let's head back.

313
00:20:56,980 --> 00:20:59,520
I'm such a liar.

314
00:21:00,230 --> 00:21:02,240
I never actually had a choice.

315
00:21:01,990 --> 00:21:07,530
If only the summer fireworks

316
00:21:01,990 --> 00:21:07,530
manatsu ni kieta hanabi ga

317
00:21:02,820 --> 00:21:04,070
Yoshioka?

318
00:21:05,410 --> 00:21:08,330
Sorry, I didn't actually forget anything.

319
00:21:07,530 --> 00:21:13,460
had appeared before my tears...

320
00:21:07,530 --> 00:21:13,460
namida no saki ni utsureba

321
00:21:08,330 --> 00:21:09,790
What?!

322
00:21:09,790 --> 00:21:12,080
Don't go crazy on me.

323
00:21:12,790 --> 00:21:17,250
I pretended to hesitate, but I always knew the answer.

324
00:21:13,460 --> 00:21:18,880
I will definitely remember.

325
00:21:13,460 --> 00:21:18,880
I will kitto omoidasu wa

326
00:21:18,210 --> 00:21:19,210
Yoshioka?

327
00:21:18,880 --> 00:21:30,640
Please know that I'll be here, waiting for you.

328
00:21:18,880 --> 00:21:30,640
anata ni todoke kono basho de atashi wa matteiru

329
00:21:21,380 --> 00:21:22,340
What's wrong?

330
00:21:22,880 --> 00:21:24,300
Do you feel okay?

331
00:21:25,630 --> 00:21:28,260
And not only that...

332
00:21:29,260 --> 00:21:31,600
I already knew that Kou would get off.

333
00:21:33,430 --> 00:21:36,190
Yuuri, I'm sorry.

334
00:21:41,780 --> 00:21:43,240
I also...

335
00:21:43,740 --> 00:21:45,200
I also...

336
00:21:46,740 --> 00:21:48,280
...love Kou.

337
00:22:00,630 --> 00:22:05,760
In a town beset by a sudden shower,

338
00:22:05,760 --> 00:22:11,140
I say "See you later", and wave goodbye.

339
00:22:11,140 --> 00:22:16,600
As I watch you pass through the ticket gate, I think:

340
00:22:16,600 --> 00:22:21,900
"It never goes according to plan, does it?"

341
00:22:21,900 --> 00:22:31,620
Everything seemed incredibly fragile that day,

342
00:22:31,620 --> 00:22:37,210
but it passed, as days tend to do.

343
00:22:38,370 --> 00:22:47,760
The rails carry you away

344
00:22:47,760 --> 00:22:56,020
leaving me alone on our usual path.

345
00:22:57,140 --> 00:23:06,650
The words I prepared for you are so simple,

346
00:23:06,650 --> 00:23:15,370
so why can't I say them?

347
00:23:17,120 --> 00:23:22,330
Why can't I?

348
00:23:24,880 --> 00:23:39,890
NEXT TIME...

349
00:23:27,170 --> 00:23:30,970
It feels like god is testing me.

350
00:23:32,390 --> 00:23:33,470
But...

351
00:23:33,850 --> 00:23:37,520
I can't lie about my feelings for Kou anymore.
